# repo-gate baseline block (HelloHowAreYouHaveANiceDay/standards). Keep every line below.
# Policy (libo, 2026-10-29): gate only significant risk -- permissions, data leak, or anything that could damage
# libo's or pyline's reputation. The owner's review is required on deploy / CI / auth / secret / migration paths,
# enforced by the repo-gate ruleset (code-owner review). Normal product code is NOT gated.
/.github/            @HelloHowAreYouHaveANiceDay
/.github/CODEOWNERS  @HelloHowAreYouHaveANiceDay
wrangler.toml        @HelloHowAreYouHaveANiceDay
auth/                @HelloHowAreYouHaveANiceDay
*secret*             @HelloHowAreYouHaveANiceDay
migrations/          @HelloHowAreYouHaveANiceDay
